{"title": "Review Meeting Held on Arrangements for Amarnath Yatra", "summary": "A review meeting was held at Baltal to discuss the arrangements for the upcoming Amarnath yatra. The meeting was chaired by DIG Maqsood ul Zaman, and officials from various departments were present. The focus of the meeting was on ensuring foolproof security measures in place for the yatra. The Amarnath yatra is a significant event in Jammu and Kashmir, attracting millions of pilgrims every year.", "summary_points": ["A review meeting was held at Baltal to discuss arrangements for the Amarnath yatra.", "DIG Maqsood ul Zaman chaired the meeting.", "The focus of the meeting was on ensuring foolproof security measures.", "Intensive monitoring is in place for the yatra.", "The event has significant implications for Jammu and Kashmir."], "title_hi": "बाल्टल में यात्रा की तैयारियों पर समीक्षा बैठक", "summary_hi": "बाल्टल में यात्रा की तैयारियों पर समीक्षा बैठक हुई। इस बैठक में डीआईजी मकसूद उल ज़मान ने अध्यक्षता की, और विभिन्न विभागों से अधिकारी उपस्थित थे। इस बैठक का ध्यान सुरक्षा उपायों पर किया गया, जो यात्रा के लिए महत्वपूर्ण है। अमarnath यात्रा एक महत्वपूर्ण घटना है, जो हर साल मिलियन पilgrims को आकर्षित करती है।", "summary_points_hi": ["बाल्टल में यात्रा की तैयारियों पर समीक्षा बैठक हुई।", "डीआईजी मकसूद उल ज़मान ने इस बैठक की अध्यक्षता की।", "इस बैठक में सुरक्षा उपायों पर ध्यान दिया गया।", "यात्रा के लिए गहन निगरानी है।", "यह घटना जम्मू-कश्मीर के लिए महत्वपूर्ण है।"], "framing": {"right": "Right-leaning outlets focus on the high-intensity drill conducted by the Srinagar Police, emphasizing the layered security measures in place and the police's preparedness for the yatra. They also highlight the significance of the event and the potential threats to national security."}, "framing_hi": {"right": "सिनियर समाचार संगठनों ने सिर्फ एक ही बिंदु पर ध्यान केंद्रित करते हैं।"}, "topic": "Politics", "region": "India", "image_url": "", "sources": [{"source": "Greater Kashmir", "lean": "center", "langua